OL,3,GNEWSAPolice name woman who died in
OL,4,Atwo-car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 73-year-old woman who died in a fatal
OL,7,Fcollision near Tintwistle has been
OL,8,Fnamed.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said Jean
OL,11,FHigginbottom was driving her silver
OL,12,FRenault Clio in Manchester Road, near
OL,13,FMillbrook House, at about 14:30 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday when she was involved in the
OL,15,Ftwo-car collision.
OL,17,FDespite the efforts of paramedics,
OL,18,FHigginbottom, from the Hyde area of
OL,19,FManchester, was pronounced dead at the
OL,20,Fscene, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
